mation\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8129) - AMD Ryzen 9 8945HS w/ Radeon 780M Graphics (16 threads) - 31.29 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI followed these instructions to export an AAB file.\n\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/export/exporting_for_android.html\n\nSpecifically, the section under **sdkmanager** to get the Android SDK, for which I installed the exact suggested versions. I also checked \"Edge to edge\" in the export template. (See: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107742 )\n\nEverything is more or less fine, my app is in the Google Play Store, except that I see the following warnings as suggestions for next releases.  \n\n<img width=\"1104\" height=\"1099\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/30fff59f-7a07-42d7-921d-c5db4fb1eed6\" />\n\n_(The 3rd warning not included in the screenshot above is about removing `screenOrientation=\"LANDSCAPE\"` , unrelated to this issue I think)_\n\nGoal: Get rid of these warnings\nExpected: Use edge-to-edge checkbox to make this go away\nActual: Warnings\n\nI am not, on purpose, using any deprecated features. Help?\n\n\n\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Project -> Export -> Add -> Android\n2. Fill in all the required info, enable Edge to Edge\n3. Export AAB and upload to Play Console\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/ow